# Practical Workflow

## Scenario

Developer: Subhalaxmi

Task:

Create a new file called:

test-file.md

---

# Step 1: Create Feature Branch

Developer creates:

feature/subhu-testing

Work is performed only inside this branch.

---

# Step 2: Add Code

Developer adds:

test-file.md

Content:

Testing developer workflow

Commit Message:

Add initial content to test-file.md

---

# Step 3: Create Pull Request

Source:

feature/subhu-testing

Target:

develop

Pull Request Title:

Feature: Subhu Testing Workflow

Description:

Developer completed testing workflow.

Changes:

* Added test-file.md

Developer:
Subhalaxmi

---

# Step 4: Review Required

Because develop branch is protected:

GitHub blocks merge.

Status:

Review required

Merge blocked

---

# Step 5: Developer Approval Not Allowed

The person creating the Pull Request cannot approve and merge their own change.

Example:

Subhalaxmi creates PR.

Subhalaxmi cannot be final approver.

Reason:

Governance and audit requirements.

---

# Step 6: Reviewer Approval

Pramod reviews:

* Files Changed
* Code Content
* Commit History

Actions:

Review Changes
→ Approve
→ Submit Review

---

# Step 7: Merge To Develop

After approval:

feature/subhu-testing
↓
develop

GitHub creates:

Merge Pull Request #4

Result:

Code is now available in develop branch.

---

# Step 8: Promote To Stage

After testing is completed in develop:

Create new Pull Request.

Source:

develop

Target:

stage

Title:

Release Candidate v1

Description:

Promoting tested code from develop to stage.

Approved for Stage validation.

---

# Step 9: Stage Approval

Stage Approver reviews:

* Commits
* Files Changed
* Pull Request Description

If acceptable:

Approve

---

# Step 10: Merge To Stage

After approval:

develop
↓
stage

Result:

Code enters stage environment.

---

# Step 11: Promote To Production

After successful stage testing:

Create Pull Request.

Source:

stage

Target:

main

---

# Step 12: Production Approval

Production Approver reviews:

* Business impact
* Testing status
* Release readiness

Approve

---

# Step 13: Merge To Production

stage
↓
main

Result:

Code reaches production.

