# Important Governance Rules

1. No direct push to stage.

2. No direct push to main.

3. Every promotion requires Pull Request.

4. Every Pull Request requires approval.

5. Approver must be different from developer.

6. All activities remain visible in GitHub history.

7. Every release can be traced back to the responsible developer and approver.

